      "text" : "Clipper Customer Service",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g34",
      "id" : "t42",
      "text" : "BART fares are set with a mileage-based formula, therefore time-based passes (e.g., weekly or monthly) are not available.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g35",
      "id" : "t43",
      "text" : "Youth and Senior Clipper cards can be obtained",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g35",
      "id" : "t44",
      "text" : "by mail",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g35",
      "id" : "t45",
      "text" : "or there are",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g35",
      "id" : "t46",
      "text" : "multiple locations across the Bay Area",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g35",
      "id" : "t47",
      "text" : "where you can apply and immediately receive a Youth or Senior card. Applicants will need to bring documentation verifying age eligibility (for example: driver’s license, photo ID card or birth certificate).",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g36",
      "id" : "t48",
      "text" : "In August 2025, BART became the Bay Area's first",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g36",
      "id" : "t49",
      "text" : "Tap and Ride",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g36",
      "id" : "t50",
      "text" : "system, meaning riders now have the ability to pay adult fares at BART fare gates using physical contactless credit or debit cards or mobile payment methods, such as Apple Pay and Google Pay.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g36",
      "id" : "t51",
      "text" : "Those with eligibility-based discounts must continue using their physical or digital Clipper card.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g36",
      "id" : "t52",
      "text" : "Allowing discount card holders to join Tap and Ride is on the roadmap, but it is not yet available.",
