      "text" : "Discounts",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g21",
      "id" : "t9",
      "text" : "We offer a variety of discounts. There are no discounts available at the BART vending machines. All discounts are set up in advance through Clipper. A little work up front helps you save money.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g23",
      "id" : "t10",
      "text" : "Riders who use more than one transit agency in a single trip (e.g., BART to Muni) will only be charged full fare on the first operator. A transfer discount of up to $2.85 will apply on any additional transit agency the rider uses within a two-hour window. This discount is available when using Tap and Ride (contactless bank cards, Apple Pay and Google Pay) and Clipper card users once their cards has been upgraded to the new system, a process customers can initiate by logging into your account on the new account-based",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g23",
      "id" : "t11",
      "text" : "Clipper website",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g23",
      "id" : "t12",
      "text" : ".",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g24",
      "id" : "t13",
      "text" : "Low income adults earning 200% or less of the federal poverty level get 50% off through the regional",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g24",
      "id" : "t14",
      "text" : "Clipper START program",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g24",
      "id" : "t15",
      "text" : ".",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g25",
      "id" : "t16",
      "text" : "Youth 5-18 years old get 50% off with a",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g25",
      "id" : "t17",
      "text" : "Youth Clipper card",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g25",
      "id" : "t18",
      "text" : ". 4 years and younger ride free. (Search for the various locations where you can apply and immediately receive a discount card by selecting \"Staffed Locations\" under \"Location Type\" for Youth and Senior card services. They are also available by mail)",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g26",
      "id" : "t19",
      "text" : "Seniors 65 and over get 62.5% off with a",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g26",
      "id" : "t20",
      "text" : "Senior Clipper card",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g26",
      "id" : "t21",
      "text" : ". (Search for the various locations where you can apply and immediately receive a discount card by selecting \"Staffed Locations\" under \"Location Type\" for Youth and Senior card services. They are also available by mail)",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g27",
      "id" : "t22",
      "text" : "The",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g27",
      "id" : "t23",
      "text" : "Clipper Access card",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g27",
      "id" : "t24",
      "text" : "(formerly known as RTC) is a version of Clipper created for passengers under 65 with qualifying disabilities to provide 62.5% off.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g28",
      "id" : "t25",
      "text" : "BART offers a “High-value Discount.” Adult Clipper cards get a 6.25% discount on cash value rides by buying $48 worth of value for $45 or $64 worth of value for $60 when autoload is set up with your registered Clipper card. You can only purchase an HVD ticket",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g28",
      "id" : "t26",
      "text" : "online by setting up Autoload",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g28",
      "id" : "t27",
      "text" : "or through a transit benefit program. In your Clipper account, select \"Add Value\" and select “Transit Pass” then “BART” and then the amount of HVD you want.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g29",
      "id" : "t28",
      "text" : "Muni + BART monthly “A” Fast Pass is available on the Clipper card and is valid for a calendar month and lets you take unlimited rides on SFMTA/Muni vehicles and BART between the Embarcadero station to Balboa Park station in San Francisco.",
      "tooltip" : null
    },
    {
      "containerID" : "g30",
      "id" : "t29",
      "text" : "Students on a",
      "tooltip" : null
